{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5dd8521b05e18b81524c75208f75b1d83730db44fd2d8c34d80785b148f01b36", "ja": "（次の定期公演は、千早の新曲お披露目公演だ。\nそのミーティングなのに、戻りが遅くなってしまった）", "zh": "（下一场定期公演是千早的新歌发布公演。\n明明要开这个会，我却回来得太晚了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1001_p", "source_sha256": "2cd2f891f7024971c77737db55d639345cdb66f4b5a5893d0f81b682800518d4", "ja": "劇場の、次の新しい企画も考えなくちゃだし……あっ！\nしまった、セットリストがまだ確定してなかった……！", "zh": "还得考虑剧场接下来的新企划……啊！  \n糟了，演出歌单还没确定……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d8c253003fb10f762dc3e1838be8060c0092da35b90e79354645d99ab2ddf610", "ja": "し、仕方ない。詳細は後で……！", "zh": "这、没办法。详情之后再说……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1003_se", "source_sha256": "e2b679ed49b66f508294c1f48413d86b36bfd7fe992fd364ab6317491c4fef73", "ja": "バタン！", "zh": "砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3d4bc3dbd7e5979971f34d3db52e712991e2153a40c70d2e585d3b3a149dfa52", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま！　お待たせ！", "zh": "大家辛苦了！让你们久等了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1005_002chi", "source_sha256": "66562fc1d45d1a9a4d9b549f2286d19173af06fe97b36c871efb7cef20c30163", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}。\nちょうど、全員そろったところです。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n正好，大家刚刚到齐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1006_p", "source_sha256": "4a236c40b58975ee6effff9b4c47d9e636f1965d367214c386cfd84f7f47acbd", "ja": "ありがとう！　……で、せっかく全員\n来てくれたのに、申し訳ないんだけど……。", "zh": "谢谢！……不过，难得大家都来了，真是不好意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f45dd3a9bd675f0d50ff4b5ce07347e626c6b6347a5ce0df9fb08b65171a2063", "ja": "実はまだ、セットリストができてなくて……\nレッスンのスケジュールも、仮の状態なんだ。", "zh": "其实曲目单还没排出来……\n排练的日程，也还是暂定的状态。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "75f46c27bba36dd130e5610bd6e588fb19534d93575c096408853ce8d5a97db4", "ja": "はれっ、そうなんですか？", "zh": "啊，原来还没定下来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "e45fb24090148c96b8818d187a595eb734916fc9322eb5e54d552f5ca89f3d4c", "ja": "もう、お兄ちゃん？　今日がミーティングだって\nずいぶん前から決まってたのに、何やってたの？", "zh": "真是的，大哥哥？明明很久之前就定好\n今天开会了，你都在忙些什么呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "f39dd1887e95a0bd9dfb1b6b8ad617d525a251bdb63ab085f6bd73b284a5afa6", "ja": "今回は桃子たちだからいいけど。\n管理はしっかりしなきゃダメだよ。", "zh": "这次是桃子她们，所以没关系。\n但管理工作可不能马虎。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1011_p", "source_sha256": "0af3165bb027b2e9d6724d1f83016669f3cfefe869f2abb920bd3ebe30c8f6fd", "ja": "いや、まったく桃子の言うとおりだな……\n返す言葉もない。", "zh": "不，桃子说得完全没错……\n我无言以对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e269ac0396969d04e6be7d81d88a2ca0682f71d2cbc89633f88eb214bceb3c63", "ja": "発想がマンネリになってる気がして、律子に\n手伝ってもらおうと思ってたんだけど……。", "zh": "我觉得思路好像变得越来越老套了，所以本来想请律子帮忙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1013_005yay", "source_sha256": "017935d38ac3fc0a7166d588adfdc16e1d5faaabda1fa15f3d4dc1553b5fd8e8", "ja": "律子さん、今日からバラエティのお仕事で\nロケでしたよね？", "zh": "律子小姐今天开始因为综艺节目的工作，\n去出外景了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "3f94b6b3efa087327d2886e6c16783249086be21b64db0d47b602dbf2c2073ee", "ja": "うん。確か離島で、\n帰りは明日とか言ってたような……。", "zh": "嗯。我记得好像是在离岛，\n明天才会回来来着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1015_p", "source_sha256": "31f1d1f714f9169b16ac9ce18ff94f6148bc5e50cc66b4d901f31af93cf2ed0e", "ja": "あーっ、そうだった！\nしまった……。", "zh": "啊——对哦！\n糟糕了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1016_006mak", "source_sha256": "e37e622f9dc6b7dc379b4e791e172d959fd396380d29b96eae6ad990d235bb2c", "ja": "{$P$}。だったら、\n初日のレッスンはボク達だけでやりましょうか？", "zh": "{$P$}。既然这样，第一天的练习就由我们自己来吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1017_005yay", "source_sha256": "630f9bfb45e35cfa4af6816a7d777853f70741a58d32d92d7aa64d54a3788a23", "ja": "いいかも！　そうしたら、{$P$}が\nお仕事する時間ができますね！", "zh": "好像挺不错！这样一来，{$P$}\n就有时间去忙工作了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1018_002chi", "source_sha256": "317679b856fdbd64ec62c436fb21883ddd13555fef95e597ae8170dc9db4c274", "ja": "そうね。今回は、私の新曲公演ですし……。\n全体曲と新曲は確定していますから。", "zh": "是啊。毕竟这次是我的新歌公演……  \n全体曲和新歌都已经确定了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1019_002chi", "source_sha256": "2fce2d6ead85875f34d36565f590ed9cc81ce15edf530a14e9c81d480edaa68b", "ja": "セットリストが決まるまでの数回は、基本的な\nトレーニングメニューだけでも、いいと思います。", "zh": "在确定演出曲目单之前的几次训练，基本只安排训练项目，我觉得也可以。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1020_002chi", "source_sha256": "e32d114a08f45f614f5ac81815ac66e11227385e513e136f70923db4d003f1c8", "ja": "{$P$}。よかったら、\n私達に任せてもらえませんか？", "zh": "{$P$}。如果可以的话，能交给我们吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1021_p", "source_sha256": "1fc5af503a738beaec9cceec55d876ab920793d03618dd174c329ebed18b064c", "ja": "えっ……けど、いいのか？", "zh": "咦……可是，这样真的可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1022_002chi", "source_sha256": "e50332cde5d925fa1f77d7629fa20e56289d2e1de6ea0d35e01f7202dcd7500f", "ja": "はい。私がメニューを作ると、通常のトレーニングと\nあまり変わらないかもしれませんが。", "zh": "好的。要是由我来制定菜单，可能会和普通的训练没什么区别。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1023_p", "source_sha256": "42df971b51b614b377843d91957ef17a505242531468c11fb69e4494bc1d0f67", "ja": "千早の基礎トレーニングメニューか……\n大丈夫かな。", "zh": "千早的基础训练菜单啊……\n没问题吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1024_002chi", "source_sha256": "7f29bbb0c084f400c27173aac746d8bd44b22cab65a507a8a059aa7c1d71dfb6", "ja": "大丈夫……とは？", "zh": "没问题……是指什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1025_036kan", "source_sha256": "6dd3b03d94442a474aff26e80d32ec2f088b409723a50a276b445baa6ed4061f", "ja": "{$P$}さん、大丈夫ですよ！\n私、前よりもちゃんと体力つきましたから！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，没问题的！\n我已经比以前更有体力了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1026_036kan", "source_sha256": "abc208a184de68faddff713f843d6f5e61b9db043f056e060951248ad04699ec", "ja": "なので、千早さんの足を引っ張ったりしません！\n一生懸命、がんばります！", "zh": "所以，我不会拖千早小姐的后腿！\n我会拼尽全力加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1027_049mom", "source_sha256": "521760c7fd2a88b0da067702cae9fc32e6891fc054bf5294a422c9c1cd9ed6f3", "ja": "可奈さんのいうとおりだと思うな。\nお兄ちゃん、桃子たちを甘くみすぎだよ？", "zh": "我觉得就像可奈姐姐说的那样。\n哥哥，你太小看桃子她们了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1028_049mom", "source_sha256": "8660a173b27b71e40793c3b7f763413af67bbe6516130f857787cf40d8193b2f", "ja": "こう見えて、けっこう成長してるんだから。\n心配しなくても大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "别看我这样，其实我已经成长了很多。\n不用担心，没事的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1029_p", "source_sha256": "984ab6d21631819725ad84b1110a3e7fb6800674a340ec8ce2fa64fd98615cd1", "ja": "そ、そうか……なら、お願いしてみようかな。\n千早、構わないか？", "zh": "是、是这样啊……那我就拜托你试试看吧。\n千早，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1030_002chi", "source_sha256": "df6887802af1e47f2843f9d1879b7bd9f7b3a94c1675b3ca3c1841ac759d7a29", "ja": "はい、もちろんです。\nみんな、よろしくね。", "zh": "好的，当然可以。\n大家，请多多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1031_036kan", "source_sha256": "add66853250050afe28831c0418a2b1f4c34837f256844755c1af6cde2e511be", "ja": "大丈夫です！　ビシバシ鍛えちゃってください！", "zh": "没问题的！请尽管严格地锻炼我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1032_049mom", "source_sha256": "8b26234905104f39c81a3749eeae78e9e5ef5b5057fd993cc01939a2a2490d1c", "ja": "桃子もだよ。年下だからって、\n手加減なんかしなくていいからね！", "zh": "桃子也是。别因为我年纪小，就对我手下留情哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1033_005yay", "source_sha256": "1bf45324295d0ca0e6afd66bb29b1adfcd11e8c25eac5865c6d682839a9ca3bc", "ja": "桃子、そんなこと言って大丈夫？", "zh": "桃子，你说这种话真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1034_049mom", "source_sha256": "7fac6ff41bdd0bd74be161d9da5bcc31d4848f8b326a9bb88d7885bba9c00b72", "ja": "へ、平気だってば！\nね、可奈さん！", "zh": "我、我没事啦！\n对吧，可奈姐姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1035_036kan", "source_sha256": "0dafe063fc280a158bdaa885c0539f0f6e5b8cbc9fe82fa4008dc22ff437e185", "ja": "うん！\n可奈は～絶好調～♪　公演も～大成功～♪", "zh": "嗯！\n可奈现在～状态超好～♪　演出也～大获成功～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1036_006mak", "source_sha256": "a495baf95a712688ba1e4fa0c8cd857685da10f521f2a3746b368d14a4b23c69", "ja": "ふたりとも、頼もしいなあ。\n千早、明日のレッスン内容、今から相談する？", "zh": "你们两个都很可靠啊。\n千早，要不要现在商量一下明天的练习内容？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1037_002chi", "source_sha256": "2d6baf15fd0533e3d5fac1d7f40eb43a857e9b27f6a80c3c0ddb954611603e10", "ja": "そうね……でも、もう遅いし。\n明日の分だけは、私が作っておくわ。", "zh": "是啊……不过，已经很晚了。\n明天的那份就由我来准备吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1038_006mak", "source_sha256": "164a3c4a31452461884fa0ec86da6b8d2d7af01cc413a1ec3dec5397b9d42bd7", "ja": "わかった。それじゃ、明日の結果を見て、\nその後どうするか決めようか。", "zh": "知道了。那就等明天看看结果，再决定之后该怎么办吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_135_1039_002chi", "source_sha256": "ce8e6507ed009f41608392270a0631dbc745d40c102255ec3dc2dc61bd99735b", "ja": "それがいいと思う。……それじゃみんな、\n今度の定期公演、よろしくお願いします。", "zh": "我觉得这样比较好。……那么，大家，接下来的定期公演就拜托了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
